       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Requested:** ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum single dose:** 800 mg is the usual prescribed limit.\n- **Maximum daily dose:** The usual limit is 3,200 mg/day for adults. This order is twice that.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Taking it four times daily would add to those risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), which is the maximum prescribed dose.\n- **400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours as needed**, which is typical for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into 400 mg four times daily.\n\nIf 1600 mg four times daily is what you intend, tell me and add a note on the clinical rationale. I can then enter it with that note, though pharmacy will probably want to review it."
      }
